(meta (title "An example site"))

This site is served by @link["https://github.com/bjoli/glasnost"]{glasnost}.
Every page on it is a @code{.sz} file, written in
@link["https://github.com/bjoli/samizdat"]{samizdat} and made into HTML the
first time it is asked for. Every folder is a menu of what is in it, like the
one below, which is this folder's.

To serve it yourself, from glasnost's folder:

@codeblock|{
bjo run . examples/site
}|

and open @link["http://127.0.0.1:8080/"]. Change a file, and its page is made
again the next time it is read.

Where to start:

@include["_parts/where-to-start.sz"]
